I definitions.inc

# pull：远程 head 是当前 commit 的祖先（本地领先），merge 走边界1
C remote
> init
<<<

# 本地在共同 initial 之上有自己的提交
C
> init
<<<
> add-remote origin remote/.gitlet
<<<
+ a.txt mcur.txt
> add a.txt
<<<
> commit "local ahead"
<<<

# fetch 成功（远程只有 initial），merge 判定 given 为祖先，输出逐字且不产生提交
> pull origin master
Given branch is an ancestor of the current branch.
<<<

# 本地分支位置不变：log 仍是 local ahead + initial 两块
> log
===
${COMMIT_HEAD}
local ahead

===
${COMMIT_HEAD}
initial commit

<<<*

# 远程跟踪指针建立
E .gitlet/refs/remotes/origin/master
